{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S05—S08的心理转折交代得稍跳，尤其从不服气到疲惫、从怀念到重新担忧现实，Y把其中的因果关系讲得更顺。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句和【】重点让人扫屏时更容易抓住每段核心，而且感受词能随音乐的具体时刻出现，把听觉变化转化成细腻、可感的体验，不必同时处理所有信息。Y的优势是人物心理的因果解释和前后叙事衔接更完整，但较长的叙述句在听音乐时需要更多阅读注意力，音乐感受也相对概括。综合现场可读性、段落要点和音乐细节的具体程度，我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "98cb60b2-0334-4874-94b8-9200f1095246", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T181141529450Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T18:13:04.815720+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "052133a70e4bf91cad2a3446ca821d89c037895b32086cbb3a2bbb969e9e6c9f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "